[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="HUD/tutorial"]
layout_mode = 2
text = "Welcome to X Marks the Spot!

In this game, you must use your map to figure out the location of a hidden zone, and plant your flag there! If you get it wrong, you have to start the level over, whereas if you get it right you get to move on to the next level! Your map shows an overhead view of the island, but might not show the entire area, and might be missing some features (or have extra information added that isn't just what an overhead view would show...). Good luck!"

